      "writtenOn": "2026-09-23T13:38:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t have a hard requirement to have it upstream at present but I pushed upstream thinking\n1) Interfaces are not strictly tied to a service and\n2) I was under the impression that OEM specific interfaces can be pushed under OEM folders.",
