      "writtenOn": "2026-09-23T13:47:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I was under the impression that OEM specific interfaces can be pushed under OEM folders.\n\nCompany-specific directories shouldn\u0027t be considered a free-for-all sandbox though.  Other people sometimes point to them as a \"reference\" so if the design doesn\u0027t make sense in the scope of the greater project, the interfaces shouldn\u0027t be there.\n\n\u003e Interfaces are not strictly tied to a service\n\nWhen there isn\u0027t an upstream implementation, interfaces are candidates to be removed.",
      "parentUuid": "6b2829a4_f70775e0",
